<title>FRANCE: Kessler re-elected head of French insurance group.</title>
<headline>Kessler re-elected head of French insurance group.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denis Kessler has been unanimously re-elected chairman of the French insurance association Federation francaise des societes d'assurances (FFSA),(FFSA) for a third three-year term, the group said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452 jmb/pmc</p>
</text>
